NO BUILD ARTIFACTS IN THIS SOURCE TREE
=======================================

This directory tree is SOURCE CODE ONLY.
Build outputs and artifacts MUST NOT exist anywhere inside NPDev_General.

BUILD OUTPUT LOCATION
---------------------
All builds must output to:  D:\WorkSpace\NPDev\Build

FORBIDDEN ARTIFACT TYPES
-------------------------
The following directories/files must NEVER appear inside NPDev_General:

  build/          - Gradle build output
  .gradle/        - Gradle daemon and cache files
  node_modules/   - Node.js dependency installations
  *.class         - Java compiled class files (outside source JARs)
  *.jar           - Generated JARs (unless committed source JARs)
  out/            - IDE output directories
  target/         - Maven output directories

ENFORCEMENT
-----------
- If you find a build/ or .gradle/ directory here: DELETE IT.
- If you are about to run a Gradle or Node build command from this tree:
  STOP — configure the build to output to D:\WorkSpace\NPDev\Build first.
- AI agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, etc.) must NEVER run
  ./gradlew, gradle, npm install, or yarn inside this source tree
  without first verifying that build output is redirected to
  D:\WorkSpace\NPDev\Build.

This policy exists because build artifacts pollute the source tree,
confuse AI tooling, bloat state snapshots, and create false git diffs.
